// HZM Coop - Phase 2 Map Tester: Pre-Extracted Waypoints
//=========================================================================
// Per-map waypoint vector arrays for the Phase 2 teleport-tour patrol.
// SOURCE: BSP entity dumps (C:\mohaa-coop-dev\map_entities\<map>_entities.txt),
// info_pathnode "origin" values (supplemented with ai_* origins where pathnodes
// were sparse). Samples are SPATIALLY SPREAD across the playable area so the tour
// covers the whole map, not a cluster. Z kept as authored.
//
// These exist so the ~19 AI-only maps (no runtime-queryable spawner/actor source)
// can still be teleport-toured. Maps WITH live spawners keep using those; this is
// the NIL-source fallback.
//
// USAGE (from maptest_phase2.scr, after the live spawner sources):
//   if( local.spawns == NIL ){
//     local.wpvecs = waitthread coop_mod/maptest_waypoints.scr::getWaypoints local.cur
//     if( local.wpvecs != NIL ){
//       local.src           = "bsp_waypoints"
//       local.spawns        = local.wpvecs
//       local.src_isvectors = 1
//     }
//   }
// Then in the teleport loop, when local.src_isvectors, use the entry DIRECTLY as a
// vector ( local.pos = local.spawns[local.i] ) instead of local.spawns[local.i].origin.
//
// Returns a vector array (local.wp[1..N]); NIL for unknown maps.
// This file is INERT until the patrol calls it -> safe to add to the live tree.
//=========================================================================

//=========================================================================
// [user 07-22] TRIGGER TOUR (STATIC): per-map CENTER of every scripted
// trigger volume (trigger_multiple/once/use/useonce/vehicle/damagetargets),
// so the patrol teleports the player THROUGH the maps scripted events (gags,
// waves, ambushes) instead of just AI pathnodes. Deliberately excludes
// trigger_changelevel/_exit/_save/_hurt/_kill (would abort the tour or crash).
// SOURCE: OFFLINE BSP extraction (scratchpad/trigscan/extract_triggers.py) -
// runtime getentarray does NOT match brush triggers in this engine, so these
// centers are pre-computed from each BSP brush-model bounds (LUMP_MODELS,
// center = (mins+maxs)/2) plus point-trigger origins. Cap 60/map (largest vol).
// Called from maptest_phase2.scr with local.cur (the current map name).
// Returns a vector array (local.wp[1..N]); NIL for unknown maps.
//=========================================================================
getTriggerWaypoints local.mapname:{
	local.wp = NIL
